== Prepare the Mandarin Sphere ==

Combine @Sweetened Mandarin Smoothie{400%gr}, @Calcium Lactate{5%gr} and @Xanthan Gum{2%gr} using #blender{}

Blend for ~{2%minutes}

Leave to rest for ~{6%hours} or pour through a #muslin cloth{} and a #fine strainer{} to remove air from the mixture

Insert the mixture into #Spherical Moulds{}

Freeze Mixture in Moulds

== Prepare the Sodium Alginate Bath ==

Add @Sodium Alginate{5%g} to @Water{1%Liter}.

Blend for ~{2%minutes}

Let stand ~{8%hours} or degas with a #vacuum machine{} or go through a muslin cloth and a fine strainer to remove air from mixture

Put the frozen spheres in the Alginate solution

Leave for ~{3%minutes}

Remove Spheres Rinse with clean water